# Transitional package for boxes that installed the old `quota-manager` name.
# Built by .github/workflows/apt-repo.yml (never attached to a GitHub release,
# whose .deb is the real `netrex` package). It has no files: it only pulls in
# `netrex`, so `apt upgrade` moves existing installs over. Keep it published for
# several months. Comment lines (#) are stripped when rendered.
Package: quota-manager
Version: __VERSION__
Section: oldlibs
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: netrex (>= __VERSION__)
Maintainer: Youssef Alkhodary <youssef.alkhodary@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/UserJoo9/Netrex
Description: transitional package - Quota Manager is now Netrex
 This empty package only exists so that existing installs of quota-manager
 upgrade to the renamed netrex package. It can be removed once netrex is
 installed.
